# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for server-side / Worker-side Gemini AI API calls.
# - In Google AI Studio: automatically injected at runtime from user secrets.
# - In local development: set in a local .env file (never commit .env) or .dev.vars for Wrangler.
# - In Cloudflare Workers (workers.dev): configure as an encrypted Worker Secret in the
#   Cloudflare Dashboard (Workers & Pages -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets -> Add Secret)
#   or via CLI: `npx wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY`
# Never expose GEMINI_API_KEY with a VITE_ prefix or in client-side code.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: The URL where this application is hosted (e.g. https://science-of-gifts-cms.<subdomain>.workers.dev).
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"
